## What the addition must NOT do

- **Do not add the key to `PINS`** (`:455-459`). `PINS` is the v1 stanza's six pins;
  `STANZA_KEYS` (`:459`) is `TERM_KEYS` + `Object.keys(PINS)`, so a `PINS` entry would
  widen the parent-frozen v1 key set from 23 to 24 and break `STANZA_MALFORMED`
  validation of the v1 stanza. `GATE_PINS` is the correct home — it is the lane-owned
  block the round-41-2 design created for exactly this purpose.
- **Do not change `GATE_PIN_HEAD` / `GATE_PIN_CONTRACT`** (`:304-305`). The block head
  is matched by prefix (`startsWith`), so the contract id must stay
  `kumitate-gate-pins-v1`.
- **Do not add a `pin.receipt-attest` line to the v1 `kumitate-proxy-v1` stanza.** It
  would read `STANZA_KEY_UNKNOWN` and fail closed (`parseStanza`, `:994`).
